("I", "To direct the respondent No 2 to ensure implementation of the GR dated 15.09.2018 forthwith and without any delay, by issuing a writ of mandamus or any other direction, order as the case may be;"),
("J", "To direct the respondent No. 1 to create posts of typist to be attached with each post of judicial officers serving in the lower judiciary, including the District and Session Court, Civil Judge (Senior) Division, Civil Judge (Junior) Division, Chief Judicial Magistrate, Judicial Magistrate First Class and Small Causes Courts in the State of Maharashtra, over and above the stenographer posts in different grades, made available to each judicial officer, as recommended by the First National Judicial Pay Commission on Improvement of Service Conditions of Non-Judicial Staff in Subordinate Courts, 2003 (Maharashtra) as also the Manudhane Commission (1982) as well as the N.B.Dabholkar Study Group report which is accepted by the Hon'ble High Court smooth functioning of the judiciary, by issuing a writ of mandamus or any other writ, order or direction as the case may be;"),
